demonic doll </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve a haunted house filled with intriguing puzzles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a charmingly dark narrative </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plenty of jump scares. BOO!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optional jump scare warning to experience the thrill your way</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Peanut Button is an independent game studio founded by brothers Asaf Geva and Eyal Geva. The studio is known for <i>The Secret of Retropolis</i>, the critically acclaimed VR game and series.\u00a0<i>Riddlewood Manor</i> is inspired by the surreal puzzles of the <i>Rusty Lake</i> series and the spooky charm of classic cartoons like <i>Scooby-Doo</i>, <i>Courage the Cowardly Dog</i>, and <i>The Addams Family</i>.</p>","developers":["Peanut Button"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019550/27d41245a96bb34956c3be70bf0eb678ddf02781/header.jpg?t=1750450555","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-6400 CPU @ 2.70GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050Ti 4GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS Mojave (10.14)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS Sonoma (14)<br></li><li><strong>